{"id":"633963","name":"葱花蛋饼","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/633963/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4枚"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"80g"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"芝麻","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"全蛋4枚。","img":"images/633963/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加葱花、盐。","img":"images/633963/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加面粉搅拌匀。","img":"images/633963/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加水、油拌匀。","img":"images/633963/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅热倒油。","img":"images/633963/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅热刷油倒入1/3蛋液，中小火。","img":"images/633963/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"转锅使蛋液均匀铺平。","img":"images/633963/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蛋液还未凝固。","img":"images/633963/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撒黑芝麻。","img":"images/633963/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"沿着一边卷起，重复操作剩下的蛋液。","img":"images/633963/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/633963/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"配牛奶或者汤水，三个人的早餐。","img":"images/633963/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"一起吃葱花蛋饼吧！","img":"images/633963/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"加面粉时，可以选择用一点水先把面粉拌匀再加入鸡蛋，这样蛋液糊不会有面疙瘩。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}